      "question": {
        ":question/id": "45b2e799-d000-5801-973f-7fb80701d236",
        ":question/problem": "Consider an ellipse such that its major axis $a$ can vary while its minor axis is fixed. What is the best interpretation of ${S}^{\u2032}(a)$ if $S$ is the area enclosed by the ellipse?",
